Google AI Edge Gallery

The on-device LiteRT-LM engine logic in this application
(ai/src/main/java/com/notova/ai/summarize/LiteRtLmEngine.kt) is adapted from
Google AI Edge Gallery, specifically its `LlmChatModelHelper` Engine/Conversation
usage.

    Google AI Edge Gallery
    https://github.com/google-ai-edge/gallery
    Copyright 2025 Google LLC
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications by Notova: distilled to a single guarded Engine that runs one
short-lived Conversation per request, exposing text generation (summarization)
and audio-modality transcription behind Notova's own engine interfaces.

This application depends on LiteRT-LM (com.google.ai.edge.litertlm), Google's
on-device LLM runtime, distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
